### Register admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+48000000001",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Admin User",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Register passenger
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "passenger@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+48000000002",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Passenger User",
  "role": "PASSENGER"
}

### Idempotent ride request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-ride-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickup": {"lat": 52.2297, "lng": 21.0122, "address": "Warszawa Centralna"},
  "dropoff": {"lat": 52.2400, "lng": 21.0300, "address": "Centrum"},
  "vehicleType": "standard",
  "paymentMethodId": "pm_mock"
}

### Create support ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/support/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rideId": "{{rideId}}",
  "category": "PAYMENT",
  "priority": "NORMAL",
  "title": "Problem with payment",
  "description": "Passenger reports a wrong fare."
}

### Admin overview
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin ride history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/rides/{{rideId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
